 LT_B TYPE TABLE OF MCHB, LS_B TYPE MCHB,
 LT_I TYPE TABLE OF LIPS, LS_I TYPE LIPS,
 LV_W TYPE VBUK-WBSTK.
DEFINE R.
 LS_R-S = &1. LS_R-M = &2. LS_R-C = &3.
 APPEND LS_R TO LT_R.
END-OF-DEFINITION.
